6.Display statistical summary using describe().
7.Check for missing values using isnull().sum().
8.Remove null values using dropna().
9.Remove duplicate values using drop_duplicates().
10.Stop the program.

EXECUTE
import pandas as pd
df = pd.read_csv("data.csv")
print(df.head())
print(df.info())
print(df.describe())
print(df.isnull().sum())
df.dropna(inplace=True)
df.drop_duplicates(inplace=True)

