b) WAP to implement various types of visualization using Python
Algorithm
1.Start the program.
2.Import matplotlib and seaborn libraries.
3.Create data values for graphs.
4.Draw a line plot using plot().
5.Draw a bar chart using bar().
6.Draw a histogram using hist().
7.Draw a pie chart using pie().
8.Draw a scatter plot using scatter().
9.Display each graph using show().
10.Stop the program.

EXECUTE
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
import seaborn as sns

x = [1,2,3,4,5]
y = [10,20,15,25,30]

categories = ['A','B','C','D']
values = [5,7,3,8]

data = [10,20,30,30,40,40,50]

plt.figure()
plt.plot(x,y)
plt.title("Line Plot")
plt.xlabel("x-axis")
plt.ylabel("y-axis")

plt.show()

plt.figure()
plt.bar(categories,values)
plt.title("Bar Chart")
plt.show()

plt.figure()
plt.hist(data)
plt.title("Histogram")
plt.show()

plt.figure()
plt.pie(values, labels=categories, autopct='%1.1f%%')
plt.title("Pie Chart")
plt.show()

plt.figure()
plt.scatter(x,y)
plt.show()

